    "sub": "We address the astrometric precision with which a pulsar timing array can localize a single astrophysical gravitational-wave source, in the regime where pulsar distances are.",
    "sub_pt": "We address the astrometric precision with which a pulsar timing array can localize a single astrophysical gravitational-wave source, in the regime where pulsar distances are.",
