    "sub": "The U. S. National Science Foundation today announced a series of programs and initiatives to support the ambitious vision articulated in the White House report Science: A New.",
    "sub_pt": "The U. S. National Science Foundation today announced a series of programs and initiatives to support the ambitious vision articulated in the White House report Science: A New.",
    "sub_en": "The U. S. National Science Foundation today announced a series of programs and initiatives to support the ambitious vision articulated in the White House report Science: A New.",
    "excerpt": "The U. S. National Science Foundation today announced a series of programs and initiatives to support the ambitious vision articulated in the White House report Science: A New Golden Age.",
